        "readPath": "https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk/blob/master/src/d3d8/d3d8_subresource.h",
        "evidence": "D3D8Subresource::GetContainer returns the actual base texture when present, otherwise QueryInterface on its device. Use this D3D8 implementation as the bridge contract, aligned with the documented standalone D3D9 contract, while preserving ordinary texture identity."
      }
